Ground for termination of parental rights-
SF0022
guardianship.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Schuler and Landen and Representative(s)
Chestek, Clouston and Washut
AN ACT relating to children; providing that a guardianship with a relative and
a finding of unfitness may be a ground for the termination of parental rights
as specified; and providing for an effective date.
